Subject: [PATCH 20/20] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: SDX55 data channels

Keep the IP_HW0 channels, the modem carries mobile data only on them, and run them without doorbell burst mode.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
